<item>
            <title>[LU-20373] Kernel 7.1 support</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20373</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Ldiskfs changes:&lt;br/&gt;
Trivial collision:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;commit af1502f98e2cdd43504596cd438f3aa6d0be8712
Author: Weixie Cui &amp;lt;cuiweixie@gmail.com&amp;gt;
Date:   Wed Feb 25 13:02:31 2026 +0800

    ext4: simplify mballoc preallocation size rounding for small files
...
    No functional change.
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Trivial context:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;commit eb10607628acd1408a02e49b545e6421bb7a6ea2
Author: Li Chen &amp;lt;me@linux.beauty&amp;gt;
Date:   Tue Jan 20 20:19:41 2026 +0800

    ext4: remove unused i_fc_wait
    
    i_fc_wait is only initialized in ext4_fc_init_inode() and never used for
    waiting or wakeups. Drop it.
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Trivial conflict:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;commit 52b4fea162dd384792d0dec7f817e4ba5d8d4c9b
Author: NeilBrown &amp;lt;neil@brown.name&amp;gt;
Date:   Fri Mar 20 11:03:18 2026 +1100

    ext4: move dcache manipulation out of __ext4_link()
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;semi-trivial change affects patches:&lt;br/&gt;
linux-7.1/ext4-pdirop.patch and linux-7.1/ext4-give-warning-with-dir-htree-growing.patch&lt;br/&gt;
and affects osd (splitting dentry into inode / qstr)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;commit 2879374604b72bd43b346777fa05d3ac6dea9c45
Author: NeilBrown &amp;lt;neil@brown.name&amp;gt;
Date:   Fri Mar 20 11:03:16 2026 +1100

    ext4: split __ext4_add_entry() out of ext4_add_entry()

affects: ldiskfs_add_entry_locked()
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;minor impact: ext4-lookup-dotdot.patch&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;commit 14a51045e10d3087b8374deef02a9d3a694132d6
Author: Al Viro &amp;lt;viro@zeniv.linux.org.uk&amp;gt;
Date:   Wed Jan 21 18:17:12 2026 -0500

    get rid of busy-waiting in shrink_dcache_tree()
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;minor impact: ext4-kill-dx-root.patch&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;commit 0b2600f81cefcdfcda58d50df7be8fd48ada8ce2
Author: Jeff Layton &amp;lt;jlayton@kernel.org&amp;gt;
Date:   Wed Mar 4 10:32:42 2026 -0500

    treewide: change inode-&amp;gt;i_ino from unsigned long to u64
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Client:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;Client:
v7.0-rc6-4-g14a51045e10d3&apos;
   get rid of busy-waiting in shrink_dcache_tree()

v7.0-rc5-146-g4e1d77a8f382a
  folio_batch: rename pagevec.h to folio_batch.h

v7.0-rc1-1-g96fefcabf340f
  vfs: widen inode hash/lookup functions to u64
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
